  ('Receptionist', 'GB', "There are swimming lessons for children on weekday afternoons between four and six, when half the pool is reserved, and the whole pool is closed on the first Monday of every month for cleaning. Apart from that, it's open whenever the centre is."),
  ('Caller', 'IE', "That's fine, I'd be swimming in the evenings anyway. Do you have lockers?"),
  ('Receptionist', 'GB', "Yes, the lockers in the changing rooms take a one-pound coin, which you get back afterwards."),
