   Q('mcq', 'What did research at the hospital find?', 'A', 'patients who had regular visits from volunteers felt less anxious', 'Patients with volunteer visits felt less anxious and rated care more highly.', opts=['Patients who were visited felt less worried.', 'Volunteers needed more training.', 'Staff spent less time on paperwork.']),
